<% content_for :title, "Your BonID Reset Has Been Approved" %>

<h2 style="color: var(--palm-green); font-weight: 700;">Reset Approved</h2>

<div class="status-card" style="border-left-color: var(--palm-green); background: #f5fff9;">
  <strong>Status:</strong> Approved<br>
  A new BonID has been issued to you.
</div>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @submission.user.first_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>
  Your BonID reset request has been approved. Your previous QR code has been revoked,
  and a new one has been generated for your account.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= citizens_identity_submissions_url %>" class="button">View My New BonID</a>
</p>

<p>
  Please verify that all your information is correct and keep your BonID secure.
</p>

<p>BonID Verification Team</p>
